## Self review

Before returning:

- remain read-only;
- prove defects with evidence;
- separate risks from defects;
- keep scope bounded;
- stay inside Read I/O budgets;
- checklist pairs preferred before opportunistic Reads on FULL;
- no gate-token entry in `FALSE_POSITIVES_REJECTED` unless both sides
  section-Read;
- do not require opening every inventory file.
